abstract: >-
  A five-parameter family of C8/26 frames with a proposed proof of the exact
  boundary c>b^2/s under 0<s<1, m<0, gamma>0. Includes the original frame,
  a twenty-term representative, ambiguous pairs on the complementary region,
  exact data and reproducibility scripts. Local symbolic and logical checks
  passed; external review and formal verification remain incomplete.
